WEBVTT

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:17.366
(TONES PLAYING LA CUCARACHA)

00:00:23.163 --> 00:00:24.248
(ELEVATOR BELL DINGING)

00:00:34.132 --> 00:00:35.634
(ATTEMPTING TO PLAY LA CUCARACHA)

00:00:36.718 --> 00:00:38.136
(PLAYS WRONG NOTE)

00:00:38.525 --> 00:00:40.141
(EXCLAIMING IN SURPRISE)

00:00:40.995 --> 00:00:42.307
Huh.

00:00:56.370 --> 00:00:57.833
(YELLING IN AGONY)

00:01:00.290 --> 00:01:01.493
(BELL DINGS)

00:01:03.222 --> 00:01:05.205
Ah-ha! (LAUGHING)

00:01:08.515 --> 00:01:09.668
Ouch!

00:01:15.591 --> 00:01:16.633
(SIGHS)

00:01:26.402 --> 00:01:27.936
Say what?

00:01:33.645 --> 00:01:35.027
(GASPS)

00:01:40.908 --> 00:01:42.867
Would you like some peanuts or pretzels?

00:01:44.502 --> 00:01:45.557
(GASPS)

00:01:47.122 --> 00:01:48.373
(GRU LAUGHING)

00:01:48.457 --> 00:01:50.022
That's a good joke.

00:01:54.463 --> 00:01:56.170
I just did a boom boom.

00:01:56.784 --> 00:01:57.925
(GASPS)

00:01:58.345 --> 00:02:00.292
I really need you to make a choice, hon.

00:02:02.152 --> 00:02:03.639
I choose Gru.

00:02:04.348 --> 00:02:06.390
(LOUDLY) I choose Gru!

00:02:10.051 --> 00:02:11.996
Thank you, Gru stewardess!

00:02:12.189 --> 00:02:14.024
You're welcome!

00:02:32.109 --> 00:02:33.251
Aah!

00:02:47.349 --> 00:02:50.084
You have not lost your touch, my friend.

00:02:50.768 --> 00:02:53.354
Ah-ha! I knew it!

00:02:53.480 --> 00:02:55.010
You are El Macho!

00:02:55.019 --> 00:02:57.180
That's right!

00:02:57.394 --> 00:02:58.636
Nobody believed me!

00:02:58.720 --> 00:03:00.863
Ho-ho! But I knew you weren't dead!

00:03:00.917 --> 00:03:02.238
(LAUGHING)

00:03:02.551 --> 00:03:06.118
Of course not. I merely faked my death.

00:03:06.636 --> 00:03:08.829
But now, it's time for me

00:03:09.042 --> 00:03:12.354
to make a spectacular return to evil.

00:03:13.461 --> 00:03:18.375
Doctor, I think it's time we showed
Gru what we're up to here.

00:03:18.948 --> 00:03:20.426
Dr. Nefario?

00:03:20.999 --> 00:03:23.260
Nice to see you, Gru.

00:03:23.844 --> 00:03:24.886
Wha...?

00:03:24.912 --> 00:03:27.625
(STAMMERS) So, this is your
new job opportunity?

00:03:28.098 --> 00:03:30.629
Absolutely. You're gonna like this.

00:03:36.106 --> 00:03:37.194
EDUARDO: Sorry.

00:03:37.220 --> 00:03:40.741
I had to borrow some of your minions,
but it was for a worthy cause.

00:03:41.528 --> 00:03:44.079
Oh! Kevin! (GROANS IN DISGUST)

00:03:44.114 --> 00:03:46.460
No, he's not Kevin anymore.

00:03:46.818 --> 00:03:51.710
Now he is an indestructible,
mindless killing machine!

00:03:51.743 --> 00:03:52.956
Bah!

00:03:53.365 --> 00:03:55.042
Just watch this.

00:04:08.593 --> 00:04:11.088
-Bah!
-And here's the best part!

00:04:11.845 --> 00:04:15.020
I got an army of them!

00:04:16.521 --> 00:04:19.232
-(ALL GROWLING WILDLY)
-Look, look, look! (LAUGHING)

00:04:19.641 --> 00:04:20.704
(SQUEALS)

00:04:26.041 --> 00:04:27.407
Bah!

00:04:27.574 --> 00:04:31.495
Soon I will unleash them on the world,

00:04:31.661 --> 00:04:35.511
and if anyone, anyone tries
to stop them...

00:04:35.794 --> 00:04:37.000
Yeow!

00:04:37.125 --> 00:04:38.756
...their city gets eaten!

00:04:40.215 --> 00:04:41.551
We can do it together.

00:04:42.048 --> 00:04:44.216
-Together?
- Together!

00:04:44.648 --> 00:04:47.289
I have admired your work
for years, amigo.

00:04:47.502 --> 00:04:50.756
Stealing the Moon! Are you kidding?

00:04:51.181 --> 00:04:53.350
We would be unstoppable!

00:04:53.623 --> 00:04:56.068
Men like you, men like me.

00:04:56.173 --> 00:04:59.935
We should be ruling the world!

00:05:00.548 --> 00:05:01.835
So, are you in?

00:05:02.557 --> 00:05:03.718
Woo-hoo!

00:05:04.126 --> 00:05:06.039
Uh, yeah, probably.

00:05:06.780 --> 00:05:07.796
Probably?

00:05:07.851 --> 00:05:10.575
I mean, yes, yes! Of course, yes.

00:05:10.700 --> 00:05:13.171
I just have a lot going on right now.

00:05:13.537 --> 00:05:16.086
I just need to get some things
off my plate

00:05:16.431 --> 00:05:19.379
before we start
taking over the world, that's all.

00:05:20.045 --> 00:05:21.670
-Excuse me?
-No, forget it.

00:05:21.837 --> 00:05:24.500
100%! I am in!

00:05:25.178 --> 00:05:27.875
I think... Do you hear that? I do.

00:05:28.202 --> 00:05:32.097
That's Agnes calling me from
on the surface.

00:05:35.051 --> 00:05:36.296
Totally in!

00:05:38.311 --> 00:05:39.354
You know what?

00:05:39.527 --> 00:05:42.107
I am not so convinced that he is in.

00:05:50.866 --> 00:05:51.908
(KIDS CHEERING)

00:05:53.940 --> 00:05:55.392
Edith, Agnes, come on! Ooh!

00:05:55.767 --> 00:05:56.852
Oops, sorry.

00:05:57.037 --> 00:05:58.832
We need to go home now. Where is Margo?

00:05:58.855 --> 00:06:00.458
But I didn't get a turn!

00:06:07.439 --> 00:06:08.553
Margo!

00:06:08.708 --> 00:06:10.635
Come on. We're leaving...

00:06:11.192 --> 00:06:12.470
Hey, what's wrong?

00:06:12.596 --> 00:06:14.306
I hate boys.

00:06:17.517 --> 00:06:18.723
Yes. They stink.

00:06:18.776 --> 00:06:21.348
Uh, sorry. Honey, we got to go.

